{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "center",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 程式設計師修煉之道\nThe Pragmatic Programmer",
      "x": -160,
      "y": 832,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🧭 務實的哲學：對自己負責",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 100,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf1-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "提供選項，而非找藉口"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf1-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "持續學習，經營自己的知識資產"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat2",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🧱 DRY 與正交性",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 595,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf2-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 420,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-DRY原則.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf2-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 570,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "每一項知識在系統中\n都應只有單一、明確、權威的表述"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf2-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**正交性**：降低元件耦合\n改一處不牽動全身"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat3",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🪟 別放任破窗（軟體熵）",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1090,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf3-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-破窗理論與軟體熵.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf3-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "放任一個小爛攤子\n會招來更多——看到就修"
    },
    {
      "id": "cat4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 🎯 曳光彈與原型",
      "x": 300,
      "y": 1585,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 60,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf4-1",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1410,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "tools/工具-曳光彈開發.md"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf4-2",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1560,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**曳光彈**：能保留的端到端骨架\n（walking skeleton）"
    },
    {
      "id": "leaf4-3",
      "x": 660,
      "y": 1710,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 110,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**原型**：用完即丟的探索"
    }
  ],
